1
00:00:00,512 --> 00:00:02,514
[light music]

2
00:00:03,390 --> 00:00:07,019
[Riri] And so, the friendly, handsome,
and athletic Junta Hayami…

3
00:00:07,102 --> 00:00:09,438
[Junta] Uh, thanks for letting me stay.

4
00:00:10,147 --> 00:00:13,775
[Riri] …has now joined
Anzu's cozy coed living arrangement.

5
00:00:13,859 --> 00:00:14,693
[chuckles awkwardly]

6
00:00:15,318 --> 00:00:17,904
If you want to freshen up,
the bathroom is at the end of the hall.

7
00:00:18,947 --> 00:00:22,159
[Riri] This is a dream come true scenario.

8
00:00:22,993 --> 00:00:23,910
One more thing.

9
00:00:24,453 --> 00:00:26,913
Since this room only has two beds,

10
00:00:26,997 --> 00:00:28,040
would you guys mind--

11
00:00:28,123 --> 00:00:29,332
[Tsukasa and Junta] No way.

12
00:00:29,416 --> 00:00:30,792
Silly me.

13
00:00:31,293 --> 00:00:34,546
[Riri] It's just a matter of time
before the sparks of love fly!

14
00:00:35,255 --> 00:00:39,134
Well, in that case, we can move Kazuki
into my dad's office instead.

15
00:00:39,718 --> 00:00:41,136
Yeah, works for me.

16
00:00:41,636 --> 00:00:43,930
It'll be great to have a room with a desk.

17
00:00:45,390 --> 00:00:46,516
[meows]

18
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:47,476
DAD'S SELECTION

19
00:00:47,559 --> 00:00:48,393
[dad] Yay!

20
00:00:48,477 --> 00:00:51,563
-[Riri] Welcome to the love castle!
-[all groan]

21
00:00:53,482 --> 00:00:54,900
-Um…
-Huh?

22
00:00:55,817 --> 00:00:59,112
[Junta] She's so pretty,
I can't even look her in the eyes.

23
00:01:00,113 --> 00:01:02,491
I'm late for practice.
But just let me know

24
00:01:02,574 --> 00:01:04,451
if I can help out with anything, okay?

25
00:01:04,534 --> 00:01:07,037
[soft chuckle]
We've got things handled here.

26
00:01:07,120 --> 00:01:08,163
Right.

27
00:01:11,124 --> 00:01:12,167
[sighs]

28
00:01:12,250 --> 00:01:14,503
Why is all of this happening to me?

29
00:01:15,504 --> 00:01:19,174
-Yeah, it's all too exciting…
-[Anzu] Get back here!

30
00:01:19,257 --> 00:01:21,384
You're gonna pay
for that underwear incident!

31
00:01:21,468 --> 00:01:22,594
[Riri] Give it up!
[grunts]

32
00:01:23,512 --> 00:01:25,472
-[Riri screaming]
-[loud thud]

33
00:01:25,555 --> 00:01:26,598
[Anzu breathes heavily]

34
00:01:26,681 --> 00:01:30,227
[Anzu] I can't believe how nonchalant
Mom is being about this whole thing.

35
00:01:30,852 --> 00:01:33,855
Tried to steal my underwear?
Well, I guess your old mom still got it.

36
00:01:33,939 --> 00:01:34,981
MOM'S SLIGHTLY-OFF REACTION

37
00:01:35,065 --> 00:01:38,318
[chuckles mischievously]
Meanwhile, there's good news.

38
00:01:38,944 --> 00:01:41,905
[Anzu] I got a part-time job
at the convenience store.

39
00:01:42,489 --> 00:01:44,157
Hi, welcome.

40
00:01:45,283 --> 00:01:48,453
[Anzu] Kazuki's always at work,
Junta's busy with baseball,

41
00:01:48,537 --> 00:01:50,539
I bet we'll barely see each other.

42
00:01:56,128 --> 00:01:58,130
[theme music]

43
00:03:21,880 --> 00:03:23,465
#6 A "REINCARNATED-
IN-ANOTHER-WORLD" DATE

44
00:03:23,548 --> 00:03:24,883
[Junta] Morning.

45
00:03:24,966 --> 00:03:27,427
-[Tsukasa] Hey.
-[Anzu yawns] Morning.

46
00:03:27,510 --> 00:03:29,846
Anzu, did you get up early
to make us lunch?

47
00:03:29,930 --> 00:03:30,805
Yup.

48
00:03:30,889 --> 00:03:32,641
Our housemother made me.

49
00:03:32,724 --> 00:03:34,392
Who are you calling "housemother"?

50
00:03:34,476 --> 00:03:37,854
It's fine. Now there
are three lunches for us to make,

51
00:03:37,938 --> 00:03:39,564
so I should help out too.

52
00:03:39,648 --> 00:03:43,401
[groans, snores]

53
00:03:43,485 --> 00:03:46,738
You offered to help.
And lettuce is not a pillow.

54
00:03:46,821 --> 00:03:48,865
Hey, do you mind if I watch?

55
00:03:48,949 --> 00:03:50,825
[Anzu] Watch?
I'll get nervous and mess up.

56
00:03:50,909 --> 00:03:52,535
[Tsukasa] Yeah, but it won't be his fault.

57
00:03:52,619 --> 00:03:54,120
You have no faith in me at all!

58
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:57,624
Fine, I'll show you. First, the pasta.

59
00:03:57,707 --> 00:03:59,542
You know you're boiling chopsticks, right?

60
00:03:59,626 --> 00:04:00,460
[yelps]

61
00:04:00,543 --> 00:04:03,546
-[Tsukasa] You're burning Mr. Octopus.
-[Anzu screams]

62
00:04:03,630 --> 00:04:05,632
[Tsukasa] And don't crack
the eggs on your forehead.

63
00:04:05,715 --> 00:04:07,467
-[Anzu yelps]
-[Tsukasa] You're hopeless.

64
00:04:07,550 --> 00:04:09,219
[indistinct chatter]

65
00:04:13,640 --> 00:04:14,557
Hm.

66
00:04:15,642 --> 00:04:18,895
Eh? What's the deal
with your lunch today? It's a mess!

67
00:04:18,979 --> 00:04:20,647
-I'm usually jealous.
-[gasps]

68
00:04:21,648 --> 00:04:23,858
Hmm. I know what's happening here.

69
00:04:23,942 --> 00:04:26,903
You had your old bestie make it for you!

70
00:04:26,987 --> 00:04:30,073
What, I-- No, it's not like that!
My little brother made it!

71
00:04:30,156 --> 00:04:32,450
You're stuttering! We know you're lying!

72
00:04:32,534 --> 00:04:35,078
Come on, this is so not fair.

73
00:04:35,161 --> 00:04:37,831
You get a girl who's cute
and she can cook.

74
00:04:37,914 --> 00:04:39,624
From the look of it, she can't cook.

75
00:04:39,708 --> 00:04:41,918
I told you my little brother made it!

76
00:04:43,003 --> 00:04:45,630
-Did she make him a lunch?
-Yeah.

77
00:04:45,714 --> 00:04:47,924
Wow, do you think they're dating?

78
00:04:48,717 --> 00:04:50,927
[sighs, chuckles]

79
00:04:53,138 --> 00:04:54,055
[camera clicks]

80
00:04:55,390 --> 00:04:58,184
Lies! If your little brother
did make it for you,

81
00:04:58,268 --> 00:05:00,312
why are you taking a picture
and smiling like that?

82
00:05:00,395 --> 00:05:04,024
-You sure look guilty.
-Hey, knock it off already!

83
00:05:04,524 --> 00:05:05,442
STEWS
SKEWERED KATSU

84
00:05:05,525 --> 00:05:06,526
[Tsukasa] Heading home.

85
00:05:07,027 --> 00:05:09,946
Kazuki, please,
work the front of the house?

86
00:05:10,030 --> 00:05:12,699
The customers love you.
What do you say, hmm?

87
00:05:12,782 --> 00:05:15,118
-No thanks, I'll pass.
-That's too bad.

88
00:05:20,415 --> 00:05:22,417
Kazuki, hey, wait up.

89
00:05:23,001 --> 00:05:25,420
Smart turning down the front-of-house gig.

90
00:05:25,503 --> 00:05:28,048
Not like you need any more fans, right?

91
00:05:28,131 --> 00:05:31,051
Hey, wanna hang out? There's a new café.

92
00:05:31,134 --> 00:05:34,345
We can grab a quick bite to eat
and maybe-- Uh?

93
00:05:36,181 --> 00:05:37,140
Goodnight.

94
00:05:38,516 --> 00:05:40,477
Okay, maybe next time.

95
00:05:42,812 --> 00:05:43,897
[Tsukasa clears throat]

96
00:05:46,316 --> 00:05:47,275
[exhales deeply]

97
00:05:48,943 --> 00:05:50,570
[Anzu] You're home! What took so long?

98
00:05:50,653 --> 00:05:52,572
[Anzu] We've been waiting for you
to start the show!

99
00:05:52,655 --> 00:05:55,075
Well, hey, whoa, what show?

100
00:05:55,158 --> 00:05:58,328
You forgot, huh?
The show Saki recommended. Come on.

101
00:05:59,662 --> 00:06:01,247
Hurry up, go take your bath.

102
00:06:01,873 --> 00:06:04,501
Well, don't take too long.
I'm falling asleep.

103
00:06:04,584 --> 00:06:06,336
You really don't have to wait.

104
00:06:06,419 --> 00:06:08,963
-It's more fun to watch together!
-It's more fun to watch together!

105
00:06:09,047 --> 00:06:10,298
-Uh…
-Jinx.

106
00:06:10,381 --> 00:06:11,549
Mm. Uh…

107
00:06:11,633 --> 00:06:13,259
[Junta] We said it at the same time.

108
00:06:14,844 --> 00:06:16,012
[chuckles]

109
00:06:17,806 --> 00:06:19,766
[water sloshing]

110
00:06:19,849 --> 00:06:21,351
[birds chirping]

111
00:06:21,434 --> 00:06:22,268
[door opens]

112
00:06:22,352 --> 00:06:24,187
-[Junta] I'm off to practice.
-[Tsukasa] Okay.

113
00:06:24,270 --> 00:06:26,314
[Anzu] Good luck today.

114
00:06:31,027 --> 00:06:32,320
You free later?

115
00:06:32,403 --> 00:06:33,530
Huh?

116
00:06:34,489 --> 00:06:35,824
[Tsukasa] I'll take that as a yes.

117
00:06:36,407 --> 00:06:37,951
I have to go shopping today.

118
00:06:38,034 --> 00:06:39,828
Would you like to come with me?

119
00:06:39,911 --> 00:06:41,913
[Anzu] Me? Yeah, I guess I can.

120
00:06:41,996 --> 00:06:43,331
Why not ask Makoto?

121
00:06:43,998 --> 00:06:46,876
-[Tsukasa] I did. He's busy.
-[Anzu] Okay.

122
00:06:46,960 --> 00:06:50,797
I guess I could.
But don't you normally shop alone?

123
00:06:50,880 --> 00:06:53,341
It's nice to have a shield
from other girls.

124
00:06:53,424 --> 00:06:56,261
Oh well, then I salute your hotness.

125
00:06:57,387 --> 00:06:59,722
[Anzu] Seriously, though,
I buy all my clothes online,

126
00:06:59,806 --> 00:07:01,724
so I don't really know
where to go around here.

127
00:07:01,808 --> 00:07:03,726
[Tsukasa] It's all right,
I know where to go.

128
00:07:03,810 --> 00:07:06,938
[Anzu] Can't you just shop online?
It's way easier.

129
00:07:08,731 --> 00:07:10,066
I prefer in person.

130
00:07:11,234 --> 00:07:12,402
Hmm.

131
00:07:14,362 --> 00:07:16,614
[Anzu] Okay, let me go change.
Be right back.

132
00:07:19,284 --> 00:07:21,202
-Let's go!
-[Tsukasa] Already?

133
00:07:21,286 --> 00:07:23,413
LAME

134
00:07:23,496 --> 00:07:25,498
[comical music]

135
00:07:25,582 --> 00:07:27,542
You didn't even change your shirt.

136
00:07:28,668 --> 00:07:31,212
Why change? This is a clean shirt.

137
00:07:31,296 --> 00:07:33,131
We're not going grocery shopping.

138
00:07:33,214 --> 00:07:35,592
The jeans are one thing, but that shirt…

139
00:07:35,675 --> 00:07:36,885
How's this one?

140
00:07:36,968 --> 00:07:38,720
[Tsukasa] Do you really not see it?

141
00:07:38,803 --> 00:07:40,096
How about this?

142
00:07:40,638 --> 00:07:42,474
[Tsukasa] All of your shirts
have cats on them?

143
00:07:43,016 --> 00:07:44,184
Let me decide.

144
00:07:44,267 --> 00:07:46,686
[screeches]
No, wait!

145
00:07:46,769 --> 00:07:49,772
Ah! I'm drying my underwear!

146
00:07:49,856 --> 00:07:50,690
[sighs]

147
00:07:50,773 --> 00:07:53,318
Even your underwear looks
like something a child would wear.

148
00:07:53,401 --> 00:07:56,112
-[meows]
-How dare you? These are adorable!

149
00:07:56,196 --> 00:07:59,157
Please get those out of my face.
This is getting weird.

150
00:08:00,408 --> 00:08:01,534
So, look.

151
00:08:01,618 --> 00:08:04,579
I assumed
that you have a variety of clothing…

152
00:08:08,333 --> 00:08:09,167
MEOW

153
00:08:09,250 --> 00:08:11,044
[Tsukasa] …but this is all you've got!

154
00:08:11,127 --> 00:08:13,922
What? And just
what is so wrong with these?

155
00:08:14,005 --> 00:08:15,965
[sighs] Do you have cash?

156
00:08:16,549 --> 00:08:19,135
Well, I've got
some holiday money left over.

157
00:08:19,219 --> 00:08:20,553
Planning on using it?

158
00:08:21,137 --> 00:08:23,806
No definitive plans, but,

159
00:08:24,849 --> 00:08:26,893
I was gonna buy games with it.

160
00:08:26,976 --> 00:08:28,061
[gasps]

161
00:08:28,144 --> 00:08:29,979
Let's buy you new clothes.

162
00:08:31,147 --> 00:08:32,232
Huh?

163
00:08:33,274 --> 00:08:35,485
[screams]

164
00:08:35,568 --> 00:08:37,487
It's fine to dress comfy at home,

165
00:08:37,570 --> 00:08:39,364
but get normal outfits to wear in public.

166
00:08:39,447 --> 00:08:40,782
Cats are normal!

167
00:08:41,282 --> 00:08:43,576
[Tsukasa] Wait, I just realized,

168
00:08:43,660 --> 00:08:46,579
you're gonna have to go out
shopping in these.

169
00:08:46,663 --> 00:08:47,747
[Tsukasa groans]

170
00:08:47,830 --> 00:08:49,958
[Riri] Sorry to interrupt,
couldn't help overhearing

171
00:08:50,041 --> 00:08:51,668
and I think I can help out!

172
00:08:51,751 --> 00:08:53,586
[screams]
You're still alive?

173
00:08:53,670 --> 00:08:55,004
-Huh?
-Leave it to me.

174
00:08:55,088 --> 00:08:57,715
I'll go help Anzu pick out
something super cute!

175
00:08:58,258 --> 00:09:00,843
Just hang tight
and we'll be down in a jiff.

176
00:09:02,595 --> 00:09:03,763
[chuckles]

177
00:09:03,846 --> 00:09:05,473
Now that my wand is all clean again,

178
00:09:05,557 --> 00:09:07,892
I can finally get back to using my magic.

179
00:09:08,518 --> 00:09:11,980
Wait, the underwear thief
was totally your doing, wasn't it?

180
00:09:12,063 --> 00:09:15,483
Yup! Had to cash in a favor
at headquarters for that one.

181
00:09:15,567 --> 00:09:17,652
[in deep voice]
Headquarters just made my list.

182
00:09:18,278 --> 00:09:21,281
Now, now, give us a smile,
you've got a big date.

183
00:09:21,364 --> 00:09:22,907
So, let's go get you dressed.

184
00:09:22,991 --> 00:09:24,867
We're going shopping, it's not a date.

185
00:09:24,951 --> 00:09:27,370
And I'm not going
if you're gonna be weird.

186
00:09:27,453 --> 00:09:30,957
Hey, stop being so mean
or I'm gonna throw everything away.

187
00:09:31,457 --> 00:09:32,625
Huh?

188
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:35,336
[Riri] All of this.

189
00:09:35,920 --> 00:09:37,547
Each and every outfit.

190
00:09:37,630 --> 00:09:39,632
[ominous music]

191
00:09:43,761 --> 00:09:45,305
-[Riri] We are ready!
-[Tsukasa] Huh?

192
00:09:45,388 --> 00:09:47,765
-[door opens]
-[Riri] The wait is over.

193
00:09:48,266 --> 00:09:50,268
-Here she is.
-[Anzu yelps]

194
00:09:50,351 --> 00:09:51,477
Ooh.

195
00:09:52,854 --> 00:09:55,481
[Anzu] Did I really have
to put on all this makeup?

196
00:09:56,190 --> 00:09:57,984
This is so embarrassing.

197
00:09:58,067 --> 00:10:00,069
[bright music]

198
00:10:00,153 --> 00:10:01,529
Uh…

199
00:10:05,658 --> 00:10:08,411
Sorry… to keep you waiting.

200
00:10:09,829 --> 00:10:10,747
It's fine.

201
00:10:11,247 --> 00:10:14,667
[Anzu]  Is it really hot in here,
or am I nervous?

202
00:10:14,751 --> 00:10:16,085
This is really exciting.

203
00:10:16,961 --> 00:10:18,546
-[Tsukasa] Let's go.
-Right.

204
00:10:19,130 --> 00:10:22,258
All dressed up like that. You look nice.

205
00:10:25,345 --> 00:10:28,181
[muffled grunt]

206
00:10:28,765 --> 00:10:29,932
What's with your face?

207
00:10:30,016 --> 00:10:32,477
[in deep voice]
I feel like I look weird in this.

208
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:34,062
Your face is weird.

209
00:10:34,937 --> 00:10:36,856
[Anzu] Oh, man.
Here I am, all dressed up.

210
00:10:36,939 --> 00:10:39,067
-[Anzu] Hairdo and makeup…
-Anzu!

211
00:10:39,150 --> 00:10:41,361
New outfit counts as an expense.

212
00:10:41,944 --> 00:10:44,864
[Anzu] On my way
to go shopping with a hot guy.

213
00:10:45,448 --> 00:10:49,827
I am absolutely 100 percent
going on a date right now.

214
00:10:54,957 --> 00:10:56,959
[upbeat music]

215
00:10:57,960 --> 00:11:00,338
[indistinct chatter]

216
00:11:00,963 --> 00:11:04,467
[Anzu in deep voice] What am I
doing here? I usually just go online

217
00:11:04,550 --> 00:11:06,928
and get all the cute cat clothes
I can find.

218
00:11:07,011 --> 00:11:10,473
Everyone here is so stylish.
It's like another world.

219
00:11:10,556 --> 00:11:11,766
That face again?

220
00:11:11,849 --> 00:11:14,310
-This is how my face looks.
-It's ugly.

221
00:11:15,061 --> 00:11:16,646
[Anzu in normal voice]
Okay, that hurts.

222
00:11:16,729 --> 00:11:20,233
This place is packed.
Let's do this quickly.

223
00:11:21,692 --> 00:11:24,612
[Anzu] Kazuki, do you like hats?
I mean, 'cause you were wearing one

224
00:11:24,695 --> 00:11:26,864
when we first met
at the convenience store too.

225
00:11:27,573 --> 00:11:30,910
No, not really.
But it helps to hide my face.

226
00:11:31,452 --> 00:11:32,995
-Yeah, but…
-[girls murmuring]

227
00:11:33,079 --> 00:11:34,539
It doesn't seem to be working.

228
00:11:34,622 --> 00:11:36,290
[groans]

229
00:11:36,374 --> 00:11:37,667
So, why not wear a mask?

230
00:11:38,167 --> 00:11:39,127
[Tsukasa] I tried.

231
00:11:39,210 --> 00:11:42,088
Someone followed me home
thinking I was a celebrity.

232
00:11:42,171 --> 00:11:45,591
[Anzu] Well, I guess there's no hiding it
when you're that good-looking.

233
00:11:46,551 --> 00:11:48,970
[Anzu] Jeez,
he really hates being popular.

234
00:11:50,179 --> 00:11:54,142
I wonder if that's why he moved away,
to go to a different high school?

235
00:11:55,893 --> 00:11:57,979
[gasps, shivers]

236
00:11:58,604 --> 00:12:00,440
-[yells] Let the games begin!
-Huh?

237
00:12:00,523 --> 00:12:02,066
-[Anzu yells excitedly]
-Oh.

238
00:12:02,817 --> 00:12:03,818
Uh…

239
00:12:04,318 --> 00:12:06,320
[light music]

240
00:12:08,322 --> 00:12:10,241
[Anzu] Whoa! Kitty pajamas!

241
00:12:10,324 --> 00:12:13,703
It's cute! I want it!

242
00:12:23,504 --> 00:12:24,755
[Anzu] I can't believe it.

243
00:12:24,839 --> 00:12:28,551
I bought something with no cat on it?
No cat.

244
00:12:28,634 --> 00:12:31,012
-Is that a big deal?
-Huh?

245
00:12:31,596 --> 00:12:32,972
That's your first expense.

246
00:12:33,473 --> 00:12:34,932
[Anzu] This is not good.

247
00:12:35,016 --> 00:12:38,102
I let them dress me up
and I'm paying for a cute outfit

248
00:12:38,186 --> 00:12:40,480
that Kazuki chose for me.

249
00:12:40,563 --> 00:12:41,481
Yay!

250
00:12:41,564 --> 00:12:43,983
[Anzu] It's like I'm falling
into their trap!

251
00:12:44,066 --> 00:12:47,445
I'll show them. I'll only wear it
for special occasions!

252
00:12:47,528 --> 00:12:48,821
[moaning]

253
00:12:48,905 --> 00:12:52,033
[Anzu] I could never let Junta
see me in this.

254
00:12:52,617 --> 00:12:54,994
Hungry? Do you wanna grab a bite to eat?

255
00:12:55,495 --> 00:12:57,246
Sure, but…

256
00:12:57,330 --> 00:12:59,081
I have to go pee before that.

257
00:12:59,165 --> 00:13:00,625
Don't say "go pee."

258
00:13:01,209 --> 00:13:03,669
The bathroom was over there.
Be right back, okay?

259
00:13:03,753 --> 00:13:05,838
Sure, I'll find a place to eat.

260
00:13:05,922 --> 00:13:06,756
Uh.

261
00:13:07,340 --> 00:13:08,508
Oh, your bags.

262
00:13:11,469 --> 00:13:13,012
[chuckles]

263
00:13:16,182 --> 00:13:17,058
Hmm.

264
00:13:19,560 --> 00:13:21,562
-Hey, look at him!
-[sighs]

265
00:13:22,230 --> 00:13:24,482
[girl 1] Oh my, I wonder
if he's meeting up with someone.

266
00:13:24,565 --> 00:13:27,985
-[girl 2] Such a hottie.
-[girl 3] He's so handsome. Oh, my gosh.

267
00:13:29,654 --> 00:13:31,656
[sinister music]

268
00:13:33,032 --> 00:13:35,284
[breathing nervously]

269
00:13:36,494 --> 00:13:37,954
[Tsukasa] What's taking so long?

270
00:13:39,622 --> 00:13:40,581
[sighs]

271
00:13:41,541 --> 00:13:42,833
Wanna talk to him?

272
00:13:42,917 --> 00:13:44,418
Think he's got a girlfriend?

273
00:13:44,502 --> 00:13:46,462
Only one way to find out.

274
00:13:46,546 --> 00:13:49,465
[heart thumping]

275
00:13:50,383 --> 00:13:52,885
[Tsukasa] Oh, why do I have to wait
out in the open like this?

276
00:13:56,556 --> 00:13:59,350
Come on, hurry up and get back.

277
00:13:59,976 --> 00:14:02,979
Please, just leave me alone.

278
00:14:03,062 --> 00:14:05,856
-[heart thumping]
-[static]

279
00:14:09,151 --> 00:14:10,778
[female voice] Tsukasa…

280
00:14:11,279 --> 00:14:12,864
-[gasping]
-[heart thumping]

281
00:14:12,947 --> 00:14:14,156
[Tsukasa] Don't look at me.

282
00:14:16,284 --> 00:14:18,452
[female voice echoing]
Tsukasa…

283
00:14:18,536 --> 00:14:20,288
[gasps]

284
00:14:20,371 --> 00:14:21,455
[Tsukasa] Go away.

285
00:14:22,248 --> 00:14:23,416
Go away!

286
00:14:24,584 --> 00:14:25,626
[Anzu] Kazuki!

287
00:14:25,710 --> 00:14:27,086
[Tsukasa gasps]

288
00:14:28,963 --> 00:14:29,922
Huh.

289
00:14:33,467 --> 00:14:35,386
Sorry you had to wait,

290
00:14:35,469 --> 00:14:37,305
but I found the best store ever.

291
00:14:37,930 --> 00:14:38,764
Oh.

292
00:14:38,848 --> 00:14:40,182
[Anzu] Quick, come look!

293
00:14:40,266 --> 00:14:41,559
Huh?
[grunts]

294
00:14:41,642 --> 00:14:43,644
[gentle music]

295
00:14:50,109 --> 00:14:52,320
[Anzu giggling]

296
00:14:55,364 --> 00:14:58,534
How did I live my life before this?

297
00:15:00,202 --> 00:15:01,704
Thanks for inviting me along.

298
00:15:03,456 --> 00:15:04,290
[Tsukasa] Uh…

299
00:15:06,250 --> 00:15:07,335
[Anzu chuckles]

300
00:15:12,465 --> 00:15:13,466
It's been fun.

301
00:15:16,385 --> 00:15:18,220
Huh?
[yelps]

302
00:15:18,304 --> 00:15:20,431
[Anzu] It looks just like MomohikI!

303
00:15:21,140 --> 00:15:24,477
I want it, uh, but I spent all my money.

304
00:15:25,186 --> 00:15:26,520
I'll come back on payday.

305
00:15:27,021 --> 00:15:29,273
-I can buy it for you.
-[gasps]

306
00:15:29,857 --> 00:15:31,776
[Tsukasa] As a thanks for coming with me.

307
00:15:31,859 --> 00:15:34,278
Uh… Uh…

308
00:15:34,362 --> 00:15:35,279
MY GOD

309
00:15:35,363 --> 00:15:37,448
-[clerk] Thank you so much!
-[Anzu] Thank you so much!

310
00:15:40,534 --> 00:15:42,912
[Anzu gasping]
It's so cute!

311
00:15:42,995 --> 00:15:46,832
I love it so much.
I promise to take great care of it.

312
00:15:46,916 --> 00:15:47,917
Okay.

313
00:15:49,835 --> 00:15:51,921
Damn, it's later than I thought it was.

314
00:15:52,004 --> 00:15:53,923
-[tires screeching]
-[both] Huh?

315
00:15:54,715 --> 00:15:55,716
Anzu?

316
00:15:58,678 --> 00:16:01,472
-Wow, you change your look.
-[soft chuckle]

317
00:16:01,555 --> 00:16:02,890
It's all Riri.

318
00:16:04,266 --> 00:16:06,852
It must be new. And there are no cats.

319
00:16:07,895 --> 00:16:09,480
[Junta] She looks so cute.

320
00:16:09,563 --> 00:16:11,857
How long have you been wearing cats
on all your clothes?

321
00:16:11,941 --> 00:16:16,404
-Uh, did you two go somewhere?
-Yeah, picked up some new clothes.

322
00:16:16,487 --> 00:16:18,322
No!

323
00:16:18,406 --> 00:16:19,490
[Junta] Not fair, not fair…

324
00:16:19,573 --> 00:16:22,326
-[Tsukasa] Stop looking at me like that.
-Not fair, not fair, not fair, not fair…

325
00:16:22,410 --> 00:16:24,078
That was a long practice.

326
00:16:24,161 --> 00:16:26,580
Bet you're starving.
Does teriyaki sound good?

327
00:16:26,664 --> 00:16:28,457
Heck, yeah! Sounds great.

328
00:16:28,541 --> 00:16:31,002
I'll start making dinner
as soon as we get home.

329
00:16:31,085 --> 00:16:32,086
Can't wait.

330
00:16:32,169 --> 00:16:33,295
[Anzu chuckles]

331
00:16:34,755 --> 00:16:37,883
[Anzu] I was worried
Riri would spend the whole day meddling,

332
00:16:37,967 --> 00:16:40,678
but it actually turned out
to be pretty peaceful.

333
00:16:41,303 --> 00:16:43,848
Hey, wanna watch our show while we eat?

334
00:16:44,473 --> 00:16:45,307
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

335
00:16:45,391 --> 00:16:46,559
-Huh?
-Um…

336
00:16:46,642 --> 00:16:47,727
[both chuckle awkwardly]

337
00:16:48,394 --> 00:16:52,314
[Anzu] I can't wait to see what happened
after the zombies caught them.

338
00:16:52,398 --> 00:16:54,316
It's gonna be so good!

339
00:16:55,901 --> 00:16:57,903
[suspenseful music]

340
00:17:04,994 --> 00:17:08,706
-[screaming]
-[zombie snarling]

341
00:17:08,789 --> 00:17:11,292
[Anzu screams]
That thing! It's back!

342
00:17:11,375 --> 00:17:12,918
IT'S SUPER GROSS,
WE DISGUISED IT AS A CAKE

343
00:17:13,002 --> 00:17:16,172
Kazuki, kill it! Kill it now!

344
00:17:16,255 --> 00:17:17,465
Not again.

345
00:17:17,548 --> 00:17:20,468
IT'S SUPER GROSS,
WE DISGUISED IT AS A CAKE

346
00:17:20,551 --> 00:17:22,970
Hey, Junta, help me lift the couch.

347
00:17:23,554 --> 00:17:25,639
-[whimpers]
-[Tsukasa] What?

348
00:17:27,016 --> 00:17:28,309
[thuds]

349
00:17:30,936 --> 00:17:33,022
Fine, I'll just get it myself!

350
00:17:33,522 --> 00:17:35,149
-[grunts]
-[splats]

351
00:17:42,448 --> 00:17:44,784
Man, I'm glad you're here.

352
00:17:45,951 --> 00:17:49,789
Kazuki, I know moving in so quick
was kinda nuts,

353
00:17:49,872 --> 00:17:52,666
but you've been a lifesaver for me.

354
00:17:55,961 --> 00:17:58,547
[Junta] Unlike me,
I'm sorry I'm so useless.

355
00:17:58,631 --> 00:18:01,967
Not true, Junta,
you caught that awful panty thief!

356
00:18:02,051 --> 00:18:04,929
[Junta] I can't even protect you
from a bug.

357
00:18:05,012 --> 00:18:07,473
[Anzu] Hey, no,
those things are the worst.

358
00:18:08,224 --> 00:18:10,810
There. See?

359
00:18:10,893 --> 00:18:12,895
[light music]

360
00:18:12,978 --> 00:18:15,064
Maybe I'm the one who's being saved.

361
00:18:23,364 --> 00:18:24,406
[sighs]

362
00:18:25,407 --> 00:18:27,993
[Anzu] So far, the sleeping arrangements
have been kinda nice.

363
00:18:28,077 --> 00:18:29,995
Might just work out after all.

364
00:18:34,041 --> 00:18:35,501
[chuckling]

365
00:18:36,418 --> 00:18:39,505
Oh no, I wouldn't get
so comfortable just yet.

366
00:18:39,588 --> 00:18:42,716
I still have one more player for our game.

367
00:18:43,551 --> 00:18:45,970
[birds chirping]

368
00:18:46,053 --> 00:18:48,973
[snoring]

369
00:18:54,145 --> 00:18:55,271
Wake up!

370
00:18:55,771 --> 00:18:59,024
[gasps, screams]

371
00:18:59,650 --> 00:19:01,777
Kazuki? Why are you in my room?

372
00:19:01,861 --> 00:19:04,029
Well, I tried shouting from downstairs,

373
00:19:04,113 --> 00:19:05,447
but you were out cold.

374
00:19:05,531 --> 00:19:07,116
But my alarm…

375
00:19:07,199 --> 00:19:08,367
Oh crap!

376
00:19:08,450 --> 00:19:10,911
Just go! Go on without me!

377
00:19:10,995 --> 00:19:12,955
-Yeah, I wasn't planning on waiting.
-[whimpers]

378
00:19:13,038 --> 00:19:14,081
[door closes]

379
00:19:14,165 --> 00:19:16,125
[Anzu] I've never overslept for school!

380
00:19:16,208 --> 00:19:18,169
[pants, grunts]

381
00:19:18,252 --> 00:19:22,840
How did this happen? I'm so screwed!

382
00:19:23,674 --> 00:19:26,552
[breathing heavily]

383
00:19:26,635 --> 00:19:29,054
Oh no, I'm gonna be late!

384
00:19:29,638 --> 00:19:32,892
[Anzu] Wait. What did I just say?

385
00:19:32,975 --> 00:19:34,560
That phrase…

386
00:19:34,643 --> 00:19:37,646
It sounded so familiar.

387
00:19:38,189 --> 00:19:40,566
I'm gonna be late!

388
00:19:40,649 --> 00:19:42,443
[panting]

389
00:19:42,526 --> 00:19:43,485
[both grunt]

390
00:19:43,569 --> 00:19:46,864
[Anzu] This is way too similar
to one of those dating sim scenarios.

391
00:19:48,157 --> 00:19:51,535
There's no chance
a third guy shows up, right?

392
00:19:51,619 --> 00:19:55,039
I'm coming up on the corner.
You don't think…

393
00:19:55,623 --> 00:19:56,665
Nah, there's no way.

394
00:19:56,749 --> 00:20:00,085
I'm not even running with toast
in my mouth, so--

395
00:20:00,169 --> 00:20:01,921
-[thuds]
-[screams]

396
00:20:02,963 --> 00:20:04,173
[grunts]

397
00:20:04,673 --> 00:20:09,678
[Anzu] Uh, it was just a car,
not another cute boy. I'm safe.

398
00:20:09,762 --> 00:20:11,972
Wait! That car just hit me!

399
00:20:12,473 --> 00:20:14,016
[groans]

400
00:20:14,099 --> 00:20:16,936
[man] I'm terribly sorry, miss.
Are you hurt?

401
00:20:17,019 --> 00:20:18,020
[moans]

402
00:20:18,103 --> 00:20:20,105
[gentle music]

403
00:20:22,983 --> 00:20:24,068
Uh…

404
00:20:24,985 --> 00:20:26,904
I'm fine. Not even a scratch.

405
00:20:27,821 --> 00:20:31,492
[Hijiri] She's the one who went running
out into the street right in front of us.

406
00:20:31,575 --> 00:20:35,079
There's absolutely
no need for us to apologize to her.

407
00:20:35,162 --> 00:20:37,164
[dreamy music]

408
00:20:39,083 --> 00:20:41,710
You're the one
with the toast in your mouth?

409
00:20:42,253 --> 00:20:43,796
[exhales deeply]

410
00:20:45,381 --> 00:20:48,092
[munching]

411
00:20:50,010 --> 00:20:51,679
A fanfare, please!

412
00:20:51,762 --> 00:20:54,098
And a big congratulations!

413
00:20:54,181 --> 00:20:56,141
Did you fall for my little trick?

414
00:20:56,225 --> 00:20:59,061
I bet now you don't feel like
skipping the ending, right?

415
00:20:59,144 --> 00:21:02,815
In today's world, you can watch
whatever you want at your own convenience.

416
00:21:02,898 --> 00:21:05,567
But don't you think in that process
we've also lost something?

417
00:21:05,651 --> 00:21:08,195
[sighs]
Don't just let things be! Come on!

418
00:21:08,279 --> 00:21:10,698
Let's go on a super-duper happy adventure!

419
00:21:10,781 --> 00:21:12,616
So I can make sure I get paid.

420
00:21:12,700 --> 00:21:14,868
[closing theme music]

421
00:21:14,952 --> 00:21:15,786
♪ Ah, yeah! ♪

422
00:21:18,414 --> 00:21:19,248
♪ Let's go! ♪

423
00:21:21,583 --> 00:21:22,918
♪ Lo-love! ♪

424
00:21:24,503 --> 00:21:25,838
♪ Here we go! ♪

425
00:00:01,694 --> 00:00:05,365
In today's world, you can watch
whatever you want at your own convenience.

426
00:00:05,448 --> 00:00:08,117
But don't you think in that process
we've also lost something?

427
00:00:08,201 --> 00:00:10,745
[sighs]
Don't just let things be! Come on!

428
00:00:10,829 --> 00:00:13,248
Let's go on a super-duper happy adventure!

429
00:00:13,331 --> 00:00:15,166
So I can make sure I get paid.

430
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:17,418
[closing theme music]

431
00:00:17,502 --> 00:00:18,336
♪ Ah, yeah! ♪

432
00:00:20,964 --> 00:00:21,798
♪ Let's go! ♪

433
00:00:24,133 --> 00:00:25,468
